<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | UNITED Water Damage Restoration" description="Privacy framework for UNITED website contact requests and future analytics or messaging integrations."><article class="article-page shell"><p class="eyebrow">Legal framework</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="notice">This draft requires business and legal review before production launch.</p><h2>Information submitted</h2><p>When you request service, the site may collect contact details, location information, incident timing, and the description you provide.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Submitted information is used to review and respond to your service request, operate the website, prevent abuse, and maintain business records as required.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Cloudflare supports website delivery and spam protection. A configured email, webhook, CRM, or scheduling provider may process lead information on UNITED’s behalf.</p><h2>Analytics and SMS</h2><p>Invasive analytics are not enabled by default. Any future SMS workflow requires clear consent language, provider disclosure, retention rules, and legal review before launch.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions may be sent to <a href="mailto:info@unitedwdr.com">info@unitedwdr.com</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>
